ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁书六首 其五 陶弘景","author":"郑学醇","text":"征虏亭前祖帐还，华阳洞里即仙山。\n层楼独倚无人到，消得松风白昼閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15371,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁书六首 其六 谢几卿","author":"郑学醇","text":"谢家传得旧风流，恩宠曾陪宴乐游。\n何事垆头穷一醉，褰帷犹自对三驺。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15372,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其一 东昏侯","author":"郑学醇","text":"江南风俗竞奢华，步步金莲贴地花。\n曾忆尚衣除王导，不将清俭世传家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15373,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其二 竟陵王","author":"郑学醇","text":"竟陵宾客似梁园，才俊翩翩总在门。\n怪杀王融偏贾祸，西州烟月断人魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15374,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其三 褚渊","author":"郑学醇","text":"翠屏金屋捲流苏，秉烛曾称伟丈夫。\n世族不更时事改，舅家宗祐倩谁扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15375,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其四 陈后主","author":"郑学醇","text":"冉冉笼烟黛色新，台城堤柳不胜春。\n东风尽送廉纤雨，一洗山川旧战尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15376,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其五 陈后主","author":"郑学醇","text":"结绮临春万户空，新林犹自起东风。\n堪怜一片龟兹国，回首繁华似梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15377,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南史六首 其六 陈后主","author":"郑学醇","text":"黑头江总最名家，对御裁诗醉月华。\n万顷临平湖上草，何如一曲后庭花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15378,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其一 《魏本纪》","author":"郑学醇","text":"辎軿杂遝下遥空，天女相逢草泽中。\n岂为穷荒开历数，百年元魏各西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15379,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其二 《齐神武纪》","author":"郑学醇","text":"白道南邻紫气高，间关戎马几年劳。\n谁知青雀成鹦鹉，帝子东迁已弁髦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15380,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其三 《周太祖纪》","author":"郑学醇","text":"拓拔西东祚已移，周齐兵甲两相持。\n只今沙苑风前柳，犹似当年力战时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15381,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其四 《魏太武纪》","author":"郑学醇","text":"胡虏长驱战气雄，直从瓜步建行宫。\n旧家春燕谁为主，惟有青山似洛中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15382,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其五 《齐后妃列传》","author":"郑学醇","text":"城东玉玺属黄花，满酌清觞度岁华。\n进得淑妃难续命，不胜哀怨托琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15383,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北史六首 其六 崔浩","author":"郑学醇","text":"许身曾比汉留侯，盖世才名也拙谋。\n国史未镌身已戮，功成不共赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15384,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后周书六首 其一 苏绰","author":"郑学醇","text":"观鱼曾出汉昆明，延访徐徐并马行。\n莫道霸图无际会，六条真不愧才名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15385,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"后周书六首 其二 王褒","author":"郑学醇","text":"萧梁帝业又荆州，世胄名家宠最优。\n何事燕歌诉寒苦，自来关塞不胜愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":15386,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]